| ---: | --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| 0 | write | 100 | 0 | 100 | 1 |
| 1 | write | 100 | 100 | 100 | 0 |
| 2 | write | 100 | 200 | 100 | 0 |
| 3 | write | 100 | 300 | 100 | 0 |
| 4 | ACK | 100 | 0 | 300 | 1 |
| 5 | write | 100 | 100 | 300 | 0 |
| 6 | write | 100 | 200 | 300 | 0 |

Original packets: [100, 300]. Written 600, sent 400, buffered 200, outstanding 300.
\image(figures/nagle_original.svg)
